{"kind": "mod", "id": 1619, "name": "Lots of Loot Redux", "slug": "lots-of-loot-redux", "teaser": "Tired of having barely any loot in your raids? Lots of Loot Redux aims to bring back that old Tarkov feeling from when loot wasn't so scarce. If you are a loot goblin then this mod is for you!", "owner_name": "ArchangelWTF", "downloads": 221453, "favourites": 206, "featured": true, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": "wtf.archangel.lotsoflootredux", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Locations", "category_id": 8, "updated_at": "2026-08-04T18:02:40.000000Z", "created_at": "2024-08-03T11:39:42.000000Z", "published_at": "2024-08-03T11:39:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.1", "latest_version": "4.2.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<p>Updated with permission of <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/11181-rainbowpc/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">RainbowPC</a>, all credit to him for all of his work on this amazing mod.</p>\n<p><strong>Lots of Loot Redux</strong></p>\n<p>A mod for SPT that makes loot a lot less scarce, definitively nowhere near vanilla though this mod’s configuration file is very detailed and everything can be tuned up or down depending on the user’s needs.</p>\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\n<p>Loot in loose loot containers</p>\n<p>This mod re-adds the pre 12.12 feature of items spawning in loose containers, as well as expanding on that functionality by also allowing it to use this feature for backpacks as well.</p>\n<p>Marked rooms</p>\n<p>Lots of Loot Redux introduces full configurability for marked rooms. Want more loot? Less loot? Rare items only? With the customizable settings this mods gives you can easily fine-tune these to your liking.</p>\n<p>And plenty more!</p>\n<p><strong>Installation</strong>:\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decodi